assistantMessageEvent.content:
Interesting! What's contained in the DOM dump:
- `<cg-auto-pieces></cg-auto-pieces>` — an empty custom element.
- `<coords class="squares rank8 black left">` — a coords element that has a "squares" class! In other words, "on-square coordinates" are rendered as `<coords class="squares ...">`.

The word "square" appears only in the "on-square" board's coord class (boards 4 and 5 have coordinatesOnSquares: true), plus in body text ("coordinates on-square").

